          <h2 class="section-title">The Fine <span class="text-accent">Print.</span></h2>
          <p class="section-sub">To be eligible for prizes, your team and project must follow all of the below.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="sfg-rules reveal">
          <div class="sfg-rule"><span class="sfg-rule-num">01</span><p>All members of your team must have registered and checked in to JacHacks A2Tech.</p></div>
          <div class="sfg-rule"><span class="sfg-rule-num">02</span><p>At least one member of your team must be present to demo your project to judges.</p></div>
          <div class="sfg-rule"><span class="sfg-rule-num">03</span><p>All hacking and building must take place during hacking hours (Saturday 12:30 PM – Sunday 12:00 PM). Brainstorming beforehand is allowed and encouraged, but all coding must happen during the event. <b>We WILL check your GitHub repo.</b></p></div>
          <div class="sfg-rule"><span class="sfg-rule-num">04</span><p>Your team cannot have more than 4 people.</p></div>
          <div class="sfg-rule"><span class="sfg-rule-num">05</span><p>You cannot have more than 1 project.</p></div>
          <div class="sfg-rule"><span class="sfg-rule-num">06</span><p>Submit your project on Devpost before the deadline. Late submissions are not eligible for prizes.</p></div>
          <a href="https://jaclang.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="sfg-rule sfg-rule-hot"><span class="sfg-rule-hot-shine"></span><span class="sfg-rule-num">07</span><div class="sfg-rule-hot-body"><span class="sfg-rule-tag">★ BUILD WITH JAC</span><p>Must build a working software project using <b>Jac</b>, the AI-native programming language from Jaseci Labs. That's the one requirement: your project must meaningfully use Jac, with at least <b>40% of your code in Jac</b>. <span class="sfg-rule-link">Explore Jac at jaclang.org →</span></p></div></a>
          <a href="https://jachammer.ai" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="sfg-rule sfg-rule-hot"><span class="sfg-rule-hot-shine"></span><span class="sfg-rule-num">08</span><div class="sfg-rule-hot-body"><span class="sfg-rule-tag">★ HIGHLY ENCOURAGED</span><p>Host your web app / product through <b>Jac Hammer</b> so that judges can easily view your submission (use &ldquo;sandbox&rdquo; to host for free). <span class="sfg-rule-link">Host at jachammer.ai &rarr;</span></p></div></a>
          <div class="sfg-rule"><span class="sfg-rule-num">09</span><p>Be kind, be respectful, and build in good faith. Misrepresenting what your project actually does is grounds for disqualification.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
